 "notes": "All seven planned kinds kept; old Planner cover, Refill notebook and Planner index tabs merged into one covers-refills-inserts kind. Old Notebook \"Other notebooks\" type dropped; composition, spiral and pocket kept as types. Old ranges (Rhodia, STALOGY, Tomoe River, Sunny Light, MD, Mnemosyne, Campus) turned into archetypes or models. Moleskine Classic sizes, Rhodia No. 16 and Webnotebook names, Letts, Quo Vadis and Midori diaries, Life Noble Note and Levenger Circa details not added (only search snippets, no retrieved page). Tomoe River treated as a maker and archetype rather than a craft tradition; one tradition added for Étival papermaking. kokuyo.com corporate history was blocked (403 and firecrawl proxy error) so kokuyostore.com history was used. Kokuyo facts from knowledge."
